[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u5341\u56db\u5173\uff08\u540e\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_o",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_loop",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "... And that concludes my report of Rhodes Island's combat operations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And your assessment?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There is little reason to doubt their strength.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, Chief Wei, given their identities, I believe that from a strategic standpoint...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "... the L.G.D. is more than capable of handling the job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When it comes to fighting crime and prevent infiltration, the L.G.D. is more than sufficient.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island may be able to bring more to the table. However...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of the things that Rhodes Island has requested, there is one 'item' that we are unwilling to exchange based upon what has been offered.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "The temporary defense cooperation that you're providing is far from equal value. As things stand, your 'asking price' is a bit too high.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Kal'tsit, Miss Amiya, I hope you two both understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Wei, a temporary defense will not be enough. There are a lot of things about Reunion that you don't know about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based upon the data we gathered while fighting them, if no proactive measures are taken, Reunion will seize control of Lungmen within two weeks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "... Nonsense. There's no evidence of that--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, would you like to know the real reason Chernobog fell within one night?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Please elaborate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island wasn't just involved in the Chernobog incident... We also were caught inside the Catastrophe, and survived.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Impressive, impressive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not every day I meet someone crazy enough to have made it out of a Catastrophe alive. Miss Amiya, please continue, I'm listening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "... We fought against Reunion's leader.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? What's her name again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't recall clearly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Talulah.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, right, Talulah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, what do you think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "... This is what happened to Rhodes Island at Chernobog. Even though Reunion managed to wrest control of Chernobog from Ursus...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in order to expand, they'll have to deal with their resource shortages. Lungmen will be their next stepping stone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though you might be able to fend them off for a while, their attacks will not cease unless you handle this situation proactively.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Furthermore... There's another unknown factor - we still don't know how Ursus will respond after losing Chernobog...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha... Well spoken, young lady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Due to the seriousness of this threat and the L.G.D.'s limited manpower, I'm not opposed to considering this temporary agreement based on the terms that were detailed earlier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what I said before still holds...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "... Rhodes Island's asking price is still too high?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "In order to make sure Lungmen is properly compensated, I have two very simple conditions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, Rhodes Island will help the L.G.D. suppress the Reunion threat. This includes identifying threats within Lungmen as well as those related to fallout from Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "This also includes assessing the degree that the Infected have infiltrated Lungmen. I expect that you will share any potentially helpful information with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the second condition, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I will tell you about the second condition after you've satisfied the first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Naturally, I won't ask for anything outside of Rhodes Island's area of expertise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure I understand. Could you please elaborate, Mister Wei?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How should I put this... If Reunion causes damage that surpasses Rhodes Island's estimates...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope that you will help the L.G.D. handle the situation, which may include post-disaster management. Of course, nothing beyond your capabilities. That's roughly the gist of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I cannot say much more at this point. However, don't forget, Rhodes Island doesn't have a choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you can't accept our terms, then all the conditions we discussed, as well as your requests, will be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Wei, I would like to add one more clause to the agreement...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Any interpretation of the clauses must be agreed upon by both parties.' Is this acceptable?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... Of course. I can see your respect to Lungmen, Miss Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, do you have any objections?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "... I accept this operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems like Madam Ch'en also has her own goal now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2005_weiyw_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In any case, congratulations. You've earned Lungmen's trust. Madam Ch'en will be responsible for your arrangements.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, be aware that the Infected are not allowed to freely move around within the city, as that may cause panic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope that you will defer to the L.G.D.'s orders while carrying out your duties.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "text": "Especially, Madam Ch'en's orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen will be open to Rhodes Island, as long as your actions are in line with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Wei Yenwu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
