    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... Ugh...! That man was so difficult...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was so methodical when he spoke, and it felt like he couldn't be swayed by anything...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, you'll eventually have to learn how to deal with these people yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in the end, you did a great job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ehehe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Do I know you, Kal'tsit?;...Hello, Dr. Kal'tsit.;Please to meet you, Dr. Kal'tsit.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "... ...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, please don't give Dr. {@nickname} a hard time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*inhales sharply*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope our sacrifices... weren't in vain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcome back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
